{"displayStem":"결합 부위는 독립적인 단일형이고 θ=C/(Kd+C), Kd=1 μmol/L인 모형이다. C는 세포 뒤쪽 농도이며 앞쪽은 항상 C+1 μmol/L다. 신호 증폭·적응은 포함하지 않았다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 모의 자료 · 점 사이 직선은 경향 표시","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C07 c07-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c07-evidence\"><figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 490\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"뒤쪽 농도 C (μmol/L)와 수용체 점유율 (무차원)의 자료\"><path d=\"M80 75V405H550\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M80 405v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"80\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M174 405v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"174\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><path d=\"M268 405v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"268\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><path d=\"M362 405v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"362\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><path d=\"M456 405v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"456\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\">80</text><path d=\"M550 405v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"550\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><path d=\"M75 405h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M75 326.42857142857144h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"331.42857142857144\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.25</text><path d=\"M75 247.85714285714286h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"252.85714285714286\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.5</text><path d=\"M75 169.28571428571428h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"174.28571428571428\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.75</text><path d=\"M75 90.71428571428572h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"95.71428571428572\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><path d=\"M90 22h30\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"125\" y=\"28\">뒤쪽</text><polyline points=\"80,405 84.7,247.85714285714286 98.8,153.57142857142858 122.3,122.14285714285717 169.3,1